@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-web-sandbox README · agent-web-sandbox — personal agent web-browsing sandbox (DSH desktop plugin)：A personal safety layer for **individual** agents that have been granted a
browser and social/email accounts by their owner. It hardens the one tool that
pulls untrusted content from the open internet — the web fetcher — so that:

@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-web-sandbox README · What it does (trust layers)：> All hardening is **local and deterministic** (no model call inside the
> scanner), so it works offline and adds negligible latency.

---

