@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-web-sandbox README · Client-side canary watchdog (L3b) — now auto-wired in-plugin：The watchdog library itself (`lib/canary-watch.js`, zero `@deepseek-ai/*`
imports, no network) is still self-contained and unit-tested, so you can also
use it standalone if you prefer to run it on the desktop-client side.

